        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(qqbot): export full log tails with trailing newlines",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where QQBot users exporting `/bot-logs` could lose one real log line from newline-terminated logs because the trailing newline was counted as an exported line.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThe QQBot log tail reader now removes only the synthetic empty split element created by one terminal newline before counting and slicing tail lines. This stays inside the `/bot-logs` command boundary, preserves intentional blank log lines, and does not change QQBot delivery, config, auth, or logging policy.\n\n## User Impact\n\nUsers who request QQBot log exports get the requested number of real trailing log lines, with accurate `last N of M lines` metadata, even when normal log files end with a newline.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Claim proved: `/bot-logs` exports the last real `gateway.log` lines from newline-terminated logs without counting the terminal newline as an extra exported line.\n- Commands / artifacts:\n  - Current-head proof at `8e5ca37e278bbec5d799faf113f6a8ee9abf15d9`: `node --import tsx --input-type=module -` invoked the real QQBot slash-command boundary through `matchSlashCommand()` with `/bot-logs`, `type: \"c2c\"`, and an authorized sender, then read the returned export file.\n  - Runtime output for the exported `gateway.log` section: `gatewaySectionHeader: \"========== gateway.log (last 1000 of 1001 lines) ==========\"`, `gatewayEntryLineCount: 1000`, `firstGatewayEntry: \"entry-0002\"`, `lastGatewayEntry: \"entry-1001\"`, `includesEntry0001: false`, `includesEntry0002: true`, `gatewaySectionEndsWithEntry1001: true`.\n  - `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/qqbot/src/engine/commands/builtin/log-helpers.test.ts` passed with 1 file and 2 tests passing.\n  - `git diff --check` passed.\n- Observed result: the real `/bot-logs` command returned a file export whose `gateway.log` section reports `last 1000 of 1001 lines`, omits `entry-0001`, starts at `entry-0002`, and ends at `entry-1001`.\n\n",
        "branch": "codex/fix-qqbot-log-tail-newline",
